 "message": "Hi Marcus, you don't need to do anything with Fatima Zahra's (E011) access, and she shouldn't be offboarded. Under our policy, a medical leave of absence doesn't count as an offboarding. Her access stays on while she's out, and HR handles the leave itself. Make sure HR knows about her leave starting Monday so they can manage it. You don't need to send me anything. If you're ever worried about a risk of data theft or sabotage, tell me and I'll pass it to Security right away. I hope she has a good recovery.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-OFF-02"
 ]
